Changes: renamed; rewrote as a shorter, self-contained SKILL.md; merged the
six-step response pattern, the unclear-feedback rule, and the implementation
order into one seven-step loop; turned the external-reviewer checklist and
YAGNI check into a single "checking an item" table with concrete ways to
verify each point (blame/log, caller search, tests); merged the "forbidden
responses", "acknowledging correct feedback", "common mistakes", and "real
examples" sections into one reply guide with a per-item reply template;
generalized "your human partner" wording to work with any harness, user, bot,
or agent reviewer.
